DUSD::setFlashFee
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when minFlashFee is greater than MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert with DUSDInvalidInput
    ├── when maxFlashFee is greater than MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert with DUSDInvalidInput
    ├── when both minFlashFee and maxFlashFee are zero
    │   ├── it should set flashFee struct to zero
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new flashFee struct
    ├── when minFlashFee equals maxFlashFee
    │   ├── it should set flashFee struct correctly
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new flashFee struct
    ├── when maxFlashFee is greater than minFlashFee
    │   ├── it should set flashFee struct correctly
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new flashFee struct
    ├── when minFlashFee is greater than maxFlashFee
    │   ├── it should set flashFee struct correctly
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new flashFee struct
    └── when setting flashFee struct to same values
        ├── it should update flashFee struct to the same values
        └── it should emit SetFlashFee event with old and new flashFee struct
